# Linux-first repo, Windows-supported target (decision #38): the working tree
# must be LF on every platform. core.autocrlf=true checkouts were turning the
# TOML fixtures CRLF, which breaks the byte-exact line-splice pins in the 8.2
# forms / 8.5 loadout-editor suites. eol=lf overrides autocrlf per-checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never eol-converted.
*.ttf binary
*.glb binary
*.png binary
*.zip binary
